  m_text: "- <b>Egg durability:</b> Avoid hitting walls or obstacles hard with the nest. A heavy hit can crack or break the egg!\n\n- <b>Checkpoints:</b> If the egg breaks or you both fall, your team respawns at the nearest checkpoint.\n\n- <b>Victory:</b> Climb to the top together and carry the nest into the <color=#FBD38D><b>Win Area</b></color> to win!"
