  m_text: "- Press <b>Space</b> to jump onto blocks and clear obstacles.\n\n- <b>Jump together:</b> At a high ledge, both players must <b>jump at the same time</b>.\n\n- <b>Warning:</b> If only one player jumps, the nest tips over and the egg falls into the pit!"
